{"id":"n69338-1-7","stage":4,"title":"울먹이다 · 欲哭","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69338-1-7-1","ko":"승규한테 무슨 일 있어?","zh":"承奎怎么了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규한테","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"승규한테","audio":"/audio/51130402fabcdb47ca81.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有，起","explanation":"있다：有，起；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"15","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有，起","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"在某人身上发生某件事情。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1eca535964909ef3f697.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69338-1-7-2","ko":"모르겠어. 아까 전화를 받더니 갑자기 울먹이며 밖으로 나가더라고.","zh":"不知道，刚才接完电话，他突然哽咽着出去了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전화를","meaning":"电话","explanation":"전화：电话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20260","senseId":"2","lemma":"전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받더니","meaning":"接，接受","explanation":"받다：接，接受；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"9","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"울먹이며","meaning":"欲哭，啜泣","explanation":"울먹이다：欲哭，啜泣；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"울먹이다","audio":"/audio/e6761b6155bc0ed729c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69338","senseId":"1","lemma":"울먹이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밖으로","meaning":"外，外边","explanation":"밖：外，外边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"1","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가더라고.","meaning":"出，出去","explanation":"나가다：出，出去；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"1","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"6db518d738ede991","term":"전화","zh":"电话","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3","entryId":"20260","definition":"人们通过电话机交谈；或指通过那样传达的内容。","pronunciation":["전ː화"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接，接受","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到要求、申请、提问、攻击或信号等的作用，或指对这些做出反应。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"e6761b6155bc0ed7","term":"울먹이다","zh":"欲哭，啜泣","audio":"/audio/e6761b6155bc0ed729c4.mp3","entryId":"69338","definition":"就要哭出来。","pronunciation":["울머기다"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"越过线或界限的那边。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"出，出去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间里移动到外部。","pronunciation":["나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0f4a7ebe1291b139c6ac.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.495,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69338","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3217,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不知道，刚才接完电话，他突然哽咽着出去了。","承奎怎么了？","天气这么热，要是能下雨就好了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎怎么了？","天气这么热，要是能下雨就好了。","不知道，刚才接完电话，他突然哽咽着出去了。"],"answer":2}]}
